  "result": "Perfect! All 98 tests pass, including the 23 new tests for discount functionality.\n\n**Added to src/errors.js:**\n- `DISCOUNT_INVALID` \u2014 when discount is invalid\n\n**Updated src/invoices.js:**\n- Modified `createInvoice()` to accept and validate `discountPercent` (0-100, can be decimal)\n  - Defaults to 0 if not provided\n  - Stores discountPercent on each line\n  \n- Added `lineDiscount(line)` function:\n  - Calculates discount as: qty \u00d7 unitPrice \u00d7 discountPercent \u00f7 100\n  - Rounds to whole cents using roundCents()\n  - Clamps at 0 (no negative amounts)\n  \n- Updated `invoiceTotals(invoice)` to return `{ subtotal, discount, total }`:\n  - subtotal: sum of line totals (before discount)\n  - discount: sum of all line discounts\n  - total: subtotal - discount (clamped at 0)\n  \n- Modified `addLine()` to accept and validate `discountPercent` (same as createInvoice)\n\n**Added 23 comprehensive tests covering:**\n- Creating invoices with various discounts (whole numbers, decimals, edge cases)\n- Invalid discount validation (negative, over 100, non-number)\n- lineDiscount calculations with different percentages\n- invoiceTotals with single and multiple discounts\n- 100% discount scenarios\n- Total clamping at zero\n- addLine discount support and validation\n\nAll amounts are clamped at 0 per project rules \u2014 no negative totals ever occur.",
